# GludioHold's attacked and clan-attacked hooks on an attacker standing more than 100 above:
# the knight (35235) hit from 150 above wants to run 150 from the character, weight 30, and
# does not attack it; the clan calls reach it and its court guard clan mate (35238), also 150
# below, for nothing. The bow guard (35241, GludioBowGuard) helps a clan mate hit from any
# height (50), and hit from as high itself attacks as usual (100, its own attacked hook has no
# height test, and 50 from its own clan call).
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioBowGuard
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioCourtGuard
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 100 0 -150 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300
npc court 35238 SiegeGuard 0 100 -150 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300
npc bow 35241 SiegeGuard 0 -100 -150 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300

hit knight 22
  at knight 100 0 -150
  desires knight flee(player,150)=30
  hate knight 0
  desires court -
  hate court 0
  desires bow attack(player)=50
  hate bow 50

hit bow 22
  desires bow attack(player)=200
  hate bow 200
  hate knight 0
